{"title":"킹스메이커 ~Triple Crown~","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=pPyGl/hAd4ZrQHQT/f6wa5zmWndifbgCv5JwSeK&filename=th3","synopsis":"쿠데타로 폭군을 끌어내리고 고생 끝에 황좌를 탈환한 볼프강.\n전 황제의 소유물이었던 애동 신수혁마저 자기 것으로 만들어 황좌,사랑,복수의 트리플 크라운을 달성한다.\n신수혁은 재무대신 자리에서 볼프강을 보필하며 하루를 보내고 그런 신수혁에게 볼프강은 애정공세를 퍼붓지만\n자신을 전대 황제로부터 얻어낸 전리품으로 여긴다 믿고 선을 긋는다.\n설상가상 위태로운 황권에 반발하는 무리가 볼프강을 노리고 쿠데타를 도모하는데.....\n과연 볼프강과 신수혁은 휘청이는 황권을 바로잡고 둘 사이의 관계를 이어나갈 수 있을까?\n킹스메이커 2부의 시작 ~Triple Crown~ 그 이야기 속으로 여러분을 초대합니다!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":298,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":229,"change":{"type":"up","amount":69}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":238,"change":{"type":"down","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":82,"change":{"type":"up","amount":156}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":51,"change":{"type":"up","amount":31}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":222,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":216,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":284,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":265,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":204,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":206,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":215,"change":{"type":"down","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":249,"change":{"type":"down","amount":34}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":233,"change":{"type":"up","amount":16}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":116,"change":{"type":"up","amount":117}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":184,"change":{"type":"down","amount":68}},{"date":"2026-09-05","rank":257,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":232,"change":{"type":"up","amount":25}},{"date":"2026-09-07","rank":266,"change":{"type":"down","amount":34}},{"date":"2026-09-08","rank":257,"change":{"type":"up","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-09-10","rank":270,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"